move levelsmake room for the new stuffcheck level of targetmake sure there's always something shown for big documentsfind the line containing [node, where]move goal line a bit down from the topOnScreen determines whether or not the given location is visible for the given viewer.  It must be called when the document is locked!Now we know that we have a Tioga documentNeed to have the MAX or will fail to scroll in 1 or 2 line viewers.Needs to be bigger than glitchLines since burst input may move the caret several lines.never glitch in this casescroll to end of document; used in typescriptsselection is visible on screenmake sure that selection didn't leaveglitch failed; use general scrollù ü␀␀ò␀codeöúôKöú
